{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_039_01_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:c2908f07175141a357f9c1f7e12f7d56b54dfcf76e2a9894ee561d2bdc189113",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_e:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20d2b3b84cb33a1554501966d8e8b3ea7e6429c973368c25ff228b793de42a2f",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_e:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c39064763ad52c9178d31ba869a044469638afc1887ad1bb168fe36758b5c787",
      "text": "哎呀～，不过说真的这次，\n可全靠道流酱帮大忙了啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_e:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8962267b1bb2d79711be57fe5ae6f3095181ca013396a0e9fea7aea98459f51e",
      "text": "メイ酱它已经完全恢复精神了哦。\n现在都能自己吃饲料了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_e:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2bc841f65e3ee57ce281917d0321df80227d7652a222f43a10fbb2c4c5efde3",
      "text": "道流酱，真的太谢谢你了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_e:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7151436d302062c89ae1de28ccc2f656225d42e42ac23f04ae6b297348818ad",
      "text": "嘿嘿，怪不好意思的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98d79a3d5f0def8f2c99c3d26ca3f683404ada70c85d87c0c1615f140bd10cab",
      "text": "竟然在广播里帮忙寻找走失的鸟，\n道流酱，你还真的是偶像啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_e:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d68afb6cc962f59c9671056208d6059646c44847bc49eb91b4a47d43f902f615",
      "text": "我在这种事情上说谎也没用嘛！\n而且……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_e:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ded439abb9354e209509ac19e8668885836371fc5fae16d25cae660db2683e9d",
      "text": "提议在广播里呼吁大家的，\n是坐在这里的●●●●●●●●●●师父啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa1454b7bc8c685a28616bb66cdb22739c27ecd7958921b65fbaa48283f29a76",
      "text": "初次见面！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_e:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c199a4aa9e2e4f886b5551581ce5d4b54e3c2a600297c3e0144b2ecedf1282e",
      "text": "啊——！原来你就是传闻中的“师父”啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_e:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc513b8e72d48d2b3eeefee60a0f17f965f59806123652baf88e805ded5e76aa",
      "text": "因为道流酱一直叫你“师父”，我一直很好奇是个怎样的人呢。\n嘛，虽然听过不少关于你的事就是了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_e:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4368f2bd37df5cf0b193902c3eec6b99d93cf4227e16bc9534104eb10bdaa1c6",
      "text": "是、是这样吗。\n不过，到底是些什么事呢……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_e:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e2bff5abebd769312e2ec3d052d18f75889e75181f1f7af57217c0050597518",
      "text": "哎呀，这次也多亏了\n●●●●●●●●●●师父救场呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_e:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e85501586cba9a284cb664bd4a3f1357f1316affa1207031d6cb25bbbc65c347",
      "text": "要是●●●●●●●●●●师父遇到什么事，\n我无论如何都会第一时间赶过去的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_039mcr_01_1_2_039_01:1_2_039_01_e:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a692d620d186810458644fa250a0a17f4117239102c61d6727990f2d2bd3a22a",
      "text": "请随时依赖我哦，\n●●●●●●●●●●师父！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
